- id: P:program/contract-holds
  type: program
  name: contract-holds
  summary: The words of a text, counted by a move that keeps a contract of the program's own, which the program
    keeps too.
  why: the words of a text, counted by a move that keeps a contract of the program's own, which the program keeps
    too.
  must: []
  decided: []
  takes:
  - name: t
    type: text
  gives:
  - name: n
    type: number
  keeps:
  - counted-some
  lines: 11-25
  order: 2
  body: |
    program contract-holds
      why: the words of a text, counted by a move that keeps a contract of the program's own, which the
           program keeps too.

      takes t: text
      gives n: number
      keeps counted-some against t

      move counted(x: text): number
        keeps counted-some against x
        give words x
      end

      give counted t
    end
  moves:
  - P:move/contract-holds.counted
  steps:
  - P:step/contract-holds.1
  provenance:
    mode: derived
    sources:
    - contract-holds.thym#L11-L25
    confidence: 1
